    "diag.path_mtu.advice" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Große Pakete können unterwegs verworfen werden: Seiten laden nur halb, Downloads stocken. Setzen Sie die MTU von %1$@ auf %2$@ (als Admin: netsh interface ipv4 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent; für IPv6: netsh interface ipv6 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent) oder aktivieren Sie MSS-Clamping am Router."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Large packets can be dropped on the way, so pages hang half-loaded and downloads stall. Set the MTU of %1$@ to %2$@ (as Admin: netsh interface ipv4 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent; for IPv6: netsh interface ipv6 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent), or turn on MSS clamping on the router."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los paquetes grandes pueden perderse por el camino: las páginas se quedan a medio cargar y las descargas se atascan. Ajuste la MTU de %1$@ a %2$@ (como administrador: netsh interface ipv4 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent; para IPv6: netsh interface ipv6 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent) o active el MSS clamping en el router."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les gros paquets peuvent être perdus en route : les pages restent à moitié chargées et les téléchargements calent. Réglez la MTU de %1$@ sur %2$@ (en administrateur : netsh interface ipv4 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent ; pour l'IPv6 : netsh interface ipv6 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent) ou activez le MSS clamping sur le routeur."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pacotes grandes podem se perder no caminho: páginas ficam carregadas pela metade e downloads travam. Defina a MTU de %1$@ como %2$@ (como administrador: netsh interface ipv4 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent; para IPv6: netsh interface ipv6 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent) ou ative o MSS clamping no roteador."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gói lớn có thể bị rơi dọc đường nên trang treo nửa chừng, tải xuống chập chờn. Đặt MTU của %1$@ thành %2$@ (quyền Admin: netsh interface ipv4 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent; với IPv6: netsh interface ipv6 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent), hoặc bật MSS clamping trên router."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大数据包可能在途中被丢弃，导致网页加载到一半卡住、下载停滞。请将 %1$@ 的 MTU 设为 %2$@（以管理员身份：netsh interface ipv4 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent；IPv6：netsh interface ipv6 set subinterface \"%1$@\" mtu=%2$@ store=persistent），或在路由器上开启 MSS 钳制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "diag.path_mtu.advice_v4" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
